      "process_md": "**For Initial Training:**\nThe applicant from each Gram Panchayat will be selected on the approval of Janpad Panchayat.\n**For Refresher Training:**\nGausevaks who have received initial training will be selected on the basis of seniority.\n<br>\n\nFor queries and documentation requirements, applicants should contact:\n\n- Nearest Veterinary Officer of the concerned district\n- Incharge of the veterinary dispensary\n- Deputy Director, Veterinary Medicine\n\n"
