    "value": "cash"
  },
  "benefits": "**Initial Training:**\nTraining cost: ₹6,000.\nStipend: ₹1,200 for six months at ₹1,000 per month.\nTotal: ₹7,200 per Gausevak.\n**Refresher Training:**\nStipend: ₹500.\nStudy material: ₹100.\nTotal: ₹600 per Gausevak.\n",
